{"id": "t172-002", "text": "Lunch with Arjun. His mum is coming over from Pune on 14 November and staying until Christmas. He's slightly dreading it. She hasn't been since the twins were born, so it'll be the first time she meets them properly. He wants to take her to Bath for a day and asked if I knew anywhere good for lunch. I'll send him the name of that place on the river.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Pune", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "take her to Bath", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a day", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t172-004", "text": "Need to call Stefan back tomorrow evening about the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Stefan back", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend"}]}
{"id": "t172-011", "text": "Gareth and Tendai are coming up to visit on the 28th. I've booked the table at the Italian for 8pm.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming up to visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8pm", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t172-012", "text": "Spoke to Rahul on the phone. His girlfriend Dalia is eight weeks pregnant, but she's had awful morning sickness. They aren't telling people until the 12-week scan on 2 December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rahul", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "awful morning sickness", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "12-week scan", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 December", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t172-015", "text": "Catalina's mum is visiting from Bogotá for three weeks from the 6th. Catalina wants to take her to Edinburgh for a long weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Catalina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Bogotá", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the 6th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Catalina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "long weekend", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t172-018", "text": "Hana's partner Saanvi has a job interview in Manchester on Tuesday at 10am. If she gets it they'll move in the new year. Hana is a bit anxious about leaving her mum, who's been unwell since the summer. Saanvi's really nervous about the interview too; it's a panel of four and she has to give a presentation. Remind me to text her good luck on Monday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job interview in Manchester", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday at 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "unwell", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t172-019", "text": "Alina's brother Stefan is getting married on 18 July in Kraków. She's asked whether I'd like to come. I need to let her know by the end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 July", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "let her know", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t172-024", "text": "Yosef said his wife's due date is the 1st of February, but the midwife thinks the baby might come early. He's trying to finish the kitchen before then, and his brother is meant to be helping but keeps cancelling. He also mentioned his wife has gone off coffee completely, which he finds hilarious. I should offer to help with the painting one weekend, maybe the 22nd or 29th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due date", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st of February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "midwife", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finish the kitchen", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gone off coffee completely", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to help with the painting", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "one weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe the 22nd or 29th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t172-025", "text": "Arjun's sister Saanvi had a little girl on Tuesday night. Mum and baby are both well, and they're calling her Mira.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had a little girl", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "well", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mira", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t172-026", "text": "Femi is struggling a bit since his dad moved in with them. The kids are sharing a room and nobody's sleeping. Remind me to ring him on Sunday afternoon for a proper chat.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling a bit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved in with them", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sharing a room", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t172-028", "text": "Rachel O'Brien (Rach) from the book club is pregnant with her third. She said it was a bit of a surprise, but a happy one.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel O'Brien", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rach", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the book club", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t172-032", "text": "Joy said Kaito has started a new job at the hospital in Bristol. He's on nights for the first month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the hospital in Bristol", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on nights", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t172-035", "text": "Text from Colm: the baby came early! Little Rosa was born at 6am on the 15th, a bit small but doing well. His partner is still in hospital for a couple of days. Must sort a card and a present from all of us this week, and ask him when would be a good time to visit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Colm", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "born", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6am on the 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of days"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a card and a present from all of us", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him when would be a good time to visit", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t172-039", "text": "Rahul is going to be a godfather to Arjun's son. The christening's on 7 June at 2pm, and he's terrified of having to do a reading.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rahul", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "godfather", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 June at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reading", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}]}
{"id": "t172-040", "text": "Catalina and Joe are coming for Sunday lunch on the 23rd. Joe doesn't eat pork. Catalina is six months pregnant and can't have soft cheese, so I'll do the beef.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Catalina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Sunday lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 23rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat pork", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Catalina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't have soft cheese", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t172-041", "text": "Spoke to Amy. Her partner Hana proposed on holiday in Lisbon! They're thinking of a small wedding next summer, possibly the 14th of June. Hana's parents are thrilled; Amy's dad is being a bit quiet about it, which has upset her. They want to tell everyone properly at Amy's birthday drinks on Saturday at 8pm.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "proposed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "possibly the 14th of June", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "upset", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 8pm", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t172-042", "text": "Need to ask Alina how her dad's results were on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Alina how her dad's results were", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t172-051", "text": "Garden centre tomorrow morning, then pick up compost and bulbs.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Garden centre", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up compost and bulbs", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t172-054", "text": "Message Saanvi on Friday to see whether the christening date is confirmed, and then book the hotel.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Message Saanvi", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the hotel", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t172-055", "text": "Rachel's partner Nia has been signed off with stress for a month. Rachel is holding everything together but she's tired. I should take her out for coffee next week, maybe Tuesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off with stress", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe Tuesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t172-060", "text": "Lovely chat with Mrs Shah next door. Her granddaughter Imani has just started at Durham and she misses her terribly. She's knitting her a scarf for when she comes home on 15 December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Shah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "granddaughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imani", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at Durham", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "misses her terribly", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "comes home", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 December", "anchor": "e2"}]}
